* Easily soloable mission

* After confirming the mission with {n:Rasdinice}, go to a San d'Orian controlled {p:Campaign} area and talk to the {p:Gate Sentry}. They will either
** Give you the {p:Campaign Supplies} directly, or
** Tell you that "The supply unit carrying rations and munitions to our stronghold in this area was attacked en route, and forced to abandon the cargo. You are to locate the supplies and deliver them to their final destination."
** Tell you that "These are the supplies you are to deliver to the stronghold in this area. Some of these items are very delicate and will be destroyed if you are not careful. __Avoid all confrontation with the enemy.__"
* Additionally, you may be told: __"Some of the items are very delicate and will be destroyed if you are not careful. Avoid all confrontation with the enemy. Now move out."__.
** Engaging in combat will cause the Operation to be a failure. Simply getting aggro will not trigger this failure.
* Additionally, you may be told: __"Some of the items are raw and will spoil if not delivered immediately. You must hurry."__.
** This places a time limit on the Operation. __(information needed)__

